desc = Commands for managing NPC patrol paths
list.desc = List all active patrol paths for a world and their states
nodes.desc = List all nodes and information for a given path
nodes.worldgenId.desc = The worldgen ID
nodes.path.desc = The path UUID
new.desc = Start a new NPC patrol path
new.pathName.desc = The name of the path
new.pauseTime.desc = The pause time at waypoints (default: 0.0)
new.observationAngleDegrees.desc = The observation angle in degrees (default: 0.0)
edit.desc = Prepare to edit an existing NPC path
edit.pathId.desc = The path UUID (optional, will use entity in view if not provided)
edit.noEntityInView = No entity is view and no path ID provided!
add.desc = Add an NPC patrol path node
add.pauseTime.desc = The pause time at this waypoint (default: 0.0)
add.observationAngleDegrees.desc = The observation angle in degrees (default: 0.0)
add.index.desc = The target index (default: -1)
add.noActivePath = You need to use the 'new' command to start a path first or the 'edit' command to pick a path to edit
merge.desc = Merge a second path into the path currently being edited
merge.pathName.desc = The UUID of the path to merge
merge.noActivePath = You need to use the 'new' command to start a path first or the 'edit' command to pick a path to edit
update.desc = Commands for updating prefab path markers
update.pause.desc = Update the pause time at the given node
update.pause.entityId.desc = The entity UUID (optional, will use entity in view if not provided)
update.pause.pauseTime.desc = The pause time to set
update.observationAngle.desc = Update the observation angle at the given node
update.observationAngle.entityId.desc = The entity UUID (optional, will use entity in view if not provided)
update.observationAngle.angle.desc = The observation angle in degrees
